### 1. SIM validation (SIM 2 is inactive, so it returns offers)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sims/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{"simNumber":"1234567891235","serviceNumber":"1234567892"}

### 1b. Already active SIM (expected: 409 SIM already active)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sims/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{"simNumber":"1234567891234","serviceNumber":"1234567891"}

### 2. Basic details
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers/basic-validation
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"bob@abc.com","dob":"1998-12-12"}

### 3. Personal details
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers/personal-validation
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Bob","lastName":"Sam","confirmEmail":"bob@abc.com"}

### 4. Update address
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/customers/address
Content-Type: application/json

{"addressId":2,"uniqueIdNumber":"1234567891234568","address":"Vijaynagar","city":"Mysore","pincode":"570017","state":"Karnataka"}

### 5. ID proof + activate SIM
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers/id-validation
Content-Type: application/json

{"uniqueIdNumber":"1234567891234568","firstName":"Bob","lastName":"Sam","dateOfBirth":"1998-12-12"}
### E1. Bad SIM length -> Invalid details, please check again SIM number/Service number!
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sims/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{"simNumber":"123456789123","serviceNumber":"1234567892"}

### E2. Wrong SIM/service pair -> same message
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sims/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{"simNumber":"1234567891235","serviceNumber":"1234567891"}

### E3. Missing email -> Email/dob value is required
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers/basic-validation
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"","dob":"1998-12-12"}

### E4. Bad email -> Invalid email
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers/basic-validation
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"bob@abc.comm","dob":"1998-12-12"}

### E5. Unknown customer -> No request placed for you.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers/basic-validation
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"bob@abc.com","dob":"1990-01-01"}

### E6. Name with digit -> Firstname/Lastname should be maximum of 15 characters
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers/personal-validation
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Bob1","lastName":"Sam","confirmEmail":"bob@abc.com"}

### E7. Unknown name -> No customer found for the provided details
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers/personal-validation
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Tom","lastName":"Jerry","confirmEmail":"bob@abc.com"}

### E8. Wrong confirm email -> Invalid email details!!
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers/personal-validation
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Bob","lastName":"Sam","confirmEmail":"wrong@abc.com"}

### E9. Long address -> Address should be maximum of 25 characters
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/customers/address
Content-Type: application/json

{"addressId":2,"address":"This address is definitely longer than 25","city":"Mysore","pincode":"570017","state":"Karnataka"}

### E10. Bad pincode -> Pin should be 6 digit number
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/customers/address
Content-Type: application/json

{"addressId":2,"address":"Vijaynagar","city":"Mysore","pincode":"57001","state":"Karnataka"}

### E11. Special characters in city -> City/State should not contain any special characters except space
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/customers/address
Content-Type: application/json

{"addressId":2,"address":"Vijaynagar","city":"Mysore@#","pincode":"570017","state":"Karnataka"}

### E12. Add new address (no addressId) -> new row in CustomerAddress
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/customers/address
Content-Type: application/json

{"address":"MG Road","city":"Chennai","pincode":"600001","state":"Tamil Nadu"}

### E13. ID not 16 digits -> Id should be 16 digit
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers/id-validation
Content-Type: application/json

{"uniqueIdNumber":"123456789012345","firstName":"Bob","lastName":"Sam","dateOfBirth":"1998-12-12"}

### E14. Wrong name -> Invalid details
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers/id-validation
Content-Type: application/json

{"uniqueIdNumber":"1234567891234568","firstName":"Rob","lastName":"Sam","dateOfBirth":"1998-12-12"}

### E15. Wrong dob -> Incorrect date of birth details
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers/id-validation
Content-Type: application/json

{"uniqueIdNumber":"1234567891234568","firstName":"Bob","lastName":"Sam","dateOfBirth":"1999-01-01"}

### E16. Missing field -> All fields are mandatory
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers/id-validation
Content-Type: application/json

{"uniqueIdNumber":"1234567891234568","firstName":"","lastName":"Sam","dateOfBirth":"1998-12-12"}